  "title": "AE2 Favorites",
  "description": "Adds a favorite items feature to AE2 terminals, allowing you to pin items to the very top of the list.",
  "body": "# AE2 Favorites\n\n![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-blue.svg)\n\n为 AE2 的终端界面添加了收藏物品的功能，可以将物品固定在所有物品最顶端。\n\n> Adds a favorite items feature to AE2 terminals, allowing you to pin items to the very top of the list.\n\n---\n\n## ✨ 功能\n\n- 在 AE2 终端中按 **Shift + 鼠标中键** 固定/取消固定物品\n- 被固定的物品会显示在物品列表的最顶端\n- 支持所有 AE2 终端类型（ME 终端、合成终端等）\n\n> Press **Shift + Middle Click** to pin/unpin an item in the terminal.  \n> Pinned items will always appear at the top of the list.\n\n---\n\n## 📷 截图\n\n<img width=\"854\" height=\"480\" alt=\"a_1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8432de32-c4c3-4e9a-9447-7aab22c09a6d\" />\n\n---\n\n## 📄 许可证\n\n[MIT](LICENSE) © 2026",
